NOTE ON DATA LICENCES (not covered by the MIT licence above)

This repository contains code and style specifications only. Maps produced with
it draw on third-party data whose licences are separate and must be complied
with independently, in particular:

  - OpenStreetMap data (including Geofabrik extracts): © OpenStreetMap
    contributors, made available under the Open Data Commons Open Database
    Licence (ODbL). Attribution is required in the figure or its caption.
  - Natural Earth: public domain.
  - AWS Terrain Tiles (terrarium): see the upstream source terms.
  - Aliyun DataV administrative boundaries: see the DataV terms of service;
    redistribution of derived boundary data may be restricted.
  - Ten-dash-line dataset (China-GeoData): verify the upstream licence.

Maps of China that are published publicly generally require a map review number
(审图号) issued by the Ministry of Natural Resources. Nothing in this repository
substitutes for that procedure.
